   "speechStart": 18.874,
   "speechEnd": 20.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "接着，他调用了 kill，把库合约销毁了。",
   "spoken": "接着，他掉用了 kill，把库合约销毁了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
